    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mothering</strong><br><i>Your fate is just a hand away.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re dead\u2014probably. <br>The room is cold, quiet, and humming with something\u2026 ancient. You don\u2019t know how you got here. But <i>she</i> does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Mothering</i>, you awaken in the waiting room between life and whatever comes next. Presiding over this purgatory is <strong>The Mother</strong>, a spectral caretaker who offers you a deal: play her game, and earn another shot at life. Fail, and your eternity is no longer yours to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no ordinary game. Draw cards, bend fate, and outwit the unknown in a tense, retro-stylized card game where every choice matters. <strong>Luck</strong> can save you. <strong>Strategy</strong> can save you. Only one will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Card-based gameplay</strong> combining chance, planning, and risk management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 <strong>Multiple endings</strong> determined by the outcome of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Endlessly replayable</strong> with randomized gameplay elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf9e <strong>Retro-styled visuals</strong> evoke a hauntingly beautiful, lo-fi afterlife</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only get one life. But maybe, just maybe, you\u2019ll get another.<br><i>Beat the odds. Return to the living.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mothering</strong><br><i>Your fate is just a hand away.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re dead\u2014probably. <br>The room is cold, quiet, and humming with something\u2026 ancient. You don\u2019t know how you got here. But <i>she</i> does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Mothering</i>, you awaken in the waiting room between life and whatever comes next. Presiding over this purgatory is <strong>The Mother</strong>, a spectral caretaker who offers you a deal: play her game, and earn another shot at life. Fail, and your eternity is no longer yours to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no ordinary game. Draw cards, bend fate, and outwit the unknown in a tense, retro-stylized card game where every choice matters. <strong>Luck</strong> can save you. <strong>Strategy</strong> can save you. Only one will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Card-based gameplay</strong> combining chance, planning, and risk management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 <strong>Multiple endings</strong> determined by the outcome of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Endlessly replayable</strong> with randomized gameplay elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf9e <strong>Retro-styled visuals</strong> evoke a hauntingly beautiful, lo-fi afterlife</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only get one life. But maybe, just maybe, you\u2019ll get another.<br><i>Beat the odds. Return to the living.</i></p>",
